    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31788" root="غزر" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَزْرٌ</span></b>  [<i>Abundance in milk:</i> or <i>abundance of
milk:</i> of camels &amp;c.:] a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَزُرَتِ النَّاقَةُ</span>;
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُزْرٌ</span>; like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُونٌ</span> is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوْنٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُشْرٌ</span> of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَشْرٌ</span>. (S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A vessel made of</i> [<i>the coarse
grass called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلْفَآء</span> and <i>of palm-leaves:</i> (IDrd, K:)
a well-known Arabic word. (IDrd, TA.)

